<p align="center"><h2 align="center">LightnScript 1.0.x-1.1.x!</h2></p>
<p align="center">The classic <b>LightnScript</b> is developed by FatChing Studio in early-mid 2026, it's program player, IDE and compiler are developing using <b>twinBASIC</b>. The classic LightnScript is based on <b>Visual Basic</b>, <b>Visual Basic .NET</b> and <b>HTML</b>, and some <i>starters</i> are programming their own <i>LightnScript application</i> using <u>HTML</u>. <i>The recommended IDE</i> of classic LightnScript is <u>FatChing Designer</u> or some HTML editors.</p>
